import ../../dynlex-ui/ui/document_declarations.dl

editor {C string:name} containing {C string:initial} using {UI appearance reference:appearance} means: a UI text surface name styled "source-editor" containing initial using appearance
read only editor {C string:name} containing {C string:initial} using {UI appearance reference:appearance} means: (editor name containing initial using appearance) with read only text

to get [the UI element] {UI reference:node} [is a source editor]:
    return node's variant = "source-editor"
